<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Through Christ’s words of grace and mercy,</l><l>There’s no shortage, lack, or worry,</l><l>Don’t be bothered, vexed, or feel anxiety;</l><l>In the Jubilee of grace where</l><l>All our debt has been erased there,</l><l>We are happy, joyful, filled with ecstasy!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>When Christ is our satisfaction</l><l>And our one unique attraction,</l><l>Christ, the Savior, has become our Jubilee;</l><l>Everything is satisfying</l><l>When in all Christ is supplying</l><l>All the riches found in God’s economy!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
